{"text":"夫□□妙絶，□像以宣至理。□□憑教而□□，影現丈六，隨□□聞，唱説三乘，□於視聽，皆化兼□□□，沾千載□□。比丘慧榮□□玄流，□□□□□己□，□□□□雲才，□□□□□□。願帝□□延，亡尼魁□□及姊妹、一切含生□登彼岸，□證正覺。正光二年十二月七日。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三乘","refId":null,"text":"三乘","start":33,"end":35},{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧榮","refId":null,"text":"慧榮","start":56,"end":58},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":102,"end":104},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彼岸","refId":null,"text":"彼岸","start":106,"end":108},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":111,"end":113}]}